  "neighborhoods": "South Austin, Austin, West Side",
  "description_text": "Situated in the rear of this unique townhome community in the sought-after Austin neighborhood, this all brick two story unit feels and lives more like a single-family residence and offers a buyer with vision so much potential! This unit has a very open layout on the first floor with a combined living and dining room stretching the length of the unit, there is a half bath as well as a very spacious kitchen on the main level. Following the stairs to the second level you will find three spacious bedrooms, full bath which offer great space! What makes this unit feel so much like a single family is the added space in the basement. this is a blank slate which can add a family room, a fourth bedroom and so much more! Renovate and move in while building equity or renovate and rent while collecting passive cash flow! Either way you look at this unit this is a win win situation! Being steps from the Green Line and minutes from 290, this is truly centrally located.",
